| !SoftMIDI boot file
| Tells programs where the General MIDI SoundFont is, and adds *MIDIPlay.
| The sound modules are loaded when needed, not at boot (see LoadSound).
Set SoftMIDI$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <SoftMIDI$Dir>.!Sprites
IfThere <SoftMIDI$Dir>.SoundFont Then Set SoftMIDI$SoundFont <SoftMIDI$Dir>.SoundFont
Set Alias$MIDIPlay Obey <SoftMIDI$Dir>.Play %%*0
